mad offers to help she thinks that her prayers have been answered. As time goes by, she realizes his motives are questionable but by then she is his prisoner.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-19\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Hospital of Horrors\",\"overview\":\"When a man bursts into nurse Margie Wyler's maternity ward, screaming and threatening members of the staff, she knows her first priority is the safety of her patients. What she doesn't realize is just how dangerous this man is.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-26\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Murderous Masquerade\",\"overview\":\"18-year-old Jodie Gaines is confused, but compliant when a police car flags her down on a Tennessee back country road. However, as a plain clothed officer tells her to step out of the car, she doesn't realize she is stepping into her worst nightmare.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-02\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Terrifying Odds\",\"overview\":\"Bill Haley and his wife Christine decide to take a weekend trip to Atlantic City. They board a shuttle bus for what promises to be an uneventful ride,until the bus is hijacked by a crazed gunman. It's up to Bill to negotiate for the lives of the hostages.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-09\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"My Nightmare\",\"overview\":\"Elsa Garcia was kidnapped as an infant from an orphanage. Her abductors are a preacher and his wife, who are far from holy. Elsa's life is an unending nightmare of chores and horrific abuse, until a shocking turn of events leads to the Combs' downfall.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-16\",\"runtime\":21}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2014-02-26\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}